{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UgzMcXHa7mWjZdPkfJYNXD","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"4aa8e4c993d5fe06147c9561c949a6da36aea47e","date":"2026-06-02T17:36:06+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5421: Add visit-bills panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary (#741)","refs":"","body":"* feat: add visit-bills-panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address SonarCloud issues in visit-bills-panel\n\n- Use stable header.key instead of array index in DataTable header keys\n- Replace window with globalThis in test setup for env-agnostic access\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: resolve i18next-parser duplicate key warnings\n\n- Use `loadingDescription` for aria-label \"Loading\" (bills-table, discount-requests)\n  instead of reusing `loading` with a different default value\n- Introduce `invoiceNo` key for abbreviated \"Invoice #\" (discount-requests,\n  printable-invoice-header) so `invoiceNumber` stays consistently \"Invoice number\"\n- Normalise `totalAmount` default to sentence-case \"Total amount\" in printable invoice\n- Introduce `deleteBillFailedTryAgain` key for the bill-deletion error message,\n  separate from the existing line-item-specific `deleteFailedTryAgain`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): update invoiceNumberLabel locator to match renamed translation\n\nThe `invoiceNumber` key in translations/en.json was changed from \"Invoice #\"\nto \"Invoice number\" in 99a36cc. Update the e2e locator to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Bump billing backend dependency and fix stale invoiceNumber translations\n\n- Raise backendDependencies billing version to >=2.3.0-0 to include SNAPSHOT builds\n- Update invoiceNumber label to \"Invoice number\" across all locale files to align with the invoiceNo/invoiceNumber key split\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add viewOnly regression tests for InvoiceTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use getCoreTranslation for loading aria-label in BillsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"db22701b986ae73bc876df2327fa0f82a7fd3ed5","date":"2026-04-22T02:08:55+05:30","message":"(feat) Add delete action for pending bills (#717)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"}],"totalCount":2}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dbb53166-7ab9-46f9-959b-7fa41a6c4f8f","uuid":"b7c58564-6ea4-41a9-aa22-c01d74dd2382","timestamp":"2026-10-24T03:37:17.676Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"4aa8e4c993d5fe06147c9561c949a6da36aea47e","date":"2026-06-02T17:36:06+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5421: Add visit-bills panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary (#741)","refs":"","body":"* feat: add visit-bills-panel showing visit-scoped bills in visit summary\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address SonarCloud issues in visit-bills-panel\n\n- Use stable header.key instead of array index in DataTable header keys\n- Replace window with globalThis in test setup for env-agnostic access\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: resolve i18next-parser duplicate key warnings\n\n- Use `loadingDescription` for aria-label \"Loading\" (bills-table, discount-requests)\n  instead of reusing `loading` with a different default value\n- Introduce `invoiceNo` key for abbreviated \"Invoice #\" (discount-requests,\n  printable-invoice-header) so `invoiceNumber` stays consistently \"Invoice number\"\n- Normalise `totalAmount` default to sentence-case \"Total amount\" in printable invoice\n- Introduce `deleteBillFailedTryAgain` key for the bill-deletion error message,\n  separate from the existing line-item-specific `deleteFailedTryAgain`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(e2e): update invoiceNumberLabel locator to match renamed translation\n\nThe `invoiceNumber` key in translations/en.json was changed from \"Invoice #\"\nto \"Invoice number\" in 99a36cc. Update the e2e locator to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Bump billing backend dependency and fix stale invoiceNumber translations\n\n- Raise backendDependencies billing version to >=2.3.0-0 to include SNAPSHOT builds\n- Update invoiceNumber label to \"Invoice number\" across all locale files to align with the invoiceNo/invoiceNumber key split\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Add viewOnly regression tests for InvoiceTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Use getCoreTranslation for loading aria-label in BillsTable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (fix) Remove redundant progressbar role from BillsTable loader container\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Revert non-English translation file changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"db22701b986ae73bc876df2327fa0f82a7fd3ed5","date":"2026-04-22T02:08:55+05:30","message":"(feat) Add delete action for pending bills (#717)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"}],"totalCount":2}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UgzMcXHa7mWjZdPkfJYNXD","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
